{"name":"Deco Pink","hex":"#f6c2cc","fetched":"2026-10-12","looked":{"definitions":[{"term":"deco","whole":false,"parts":[{"part":"Noun","definitions":["Decompression."]},{"part":"Noun","definitions":["A friendship book in which people add decorative elements such as drawings, stickers and sequins.","Clipping of decoration."]}],"link":"https://en.wiktionary.org/wiki/deco"},{"term":"pink","whole":false,"parts":[{"part":"Noun","definitions":["A color reminiscent of pinks, the flowers.","Magenta, the colour evoked by red and blue light when combined."]},{"part":"Adjective","definitions":["Having a colour between red and white; pale red.","Of a fox-hunter's jacket: scarlet."]}],"link":"https://en.wiktionary.org/wiki/pink"}],"entries":[{"title":"Deco","blocks":[{"text":"Anderson Luís de Souza, also known as Deco, is a former professional footballer who primarily played as an attacking or central midfielder. Born and raised in Brazil, he played for the Portugal national team. He currently works as sporting director for Barcelona. Deco is widely considered one of the best midfielders of his generation."}],"image":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/f/fa/Deco_com_o_Fluminense_em_2013_%28cropped%29.jpg/330px-Deco_com_o_Fluminense_em_2013_%28cropped%29.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=api&utm_content=thumbnail","link":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Deco"},{"title":"Pink","blocks":[{"text":"Pink is a pale tint of red or rose, the color of the pink flower. It was first used as a color name in the late 17th century. A combination of pink and white is associated with innocence, whereas a combination of pink and black links to eroticism and seduction."}],"image":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/7/77/Pink_sapphire_ring.jpg/330px-Pink_sapphire_ring.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=api&utm_content=thumbnail","link":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Pink"}],"images":[{"srcset":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thum